<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net" agent="sampling" version="24.7.17"><diagram id="p9" name="9 ODAG1 weekly"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="0" pageScale="1" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0" /><mxCell id="1" parent="0" /><mxCell id="c1" value="ODAG1 weekly sample (UMCM / ODAG1 / WKLY, rules 1–44): rule order and the bucket tree" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=18;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="10" width="1400" height="36" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c2" value="A. The order the 44 rules run, and where each result is kept" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=15;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="60" width="900" height="30" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c3" value="Step" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="95" width="620" height="24" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="Result kept in" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="720" y="95" width="460" height="24" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value="Read: every query runs once, its result is stamped on each case in memory" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontStyle=3;fontColor=#555555;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="370" y="125" width="800" height="26" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c6" value="1. Load the config row and the 44 active rules, sorted by Seq_Nbr then Rule_ID, split by class" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="159" width="620" height="50" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c7" value="GOVT_RGLTRY_SamplingRun (RUNNING) + GOVT_RGLTRY_SamplingRunRule (44 rows)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="720" y="159" width="460" height="50" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e8" style="endArrow=block;html=1;rounded=0;dashed=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c6" target="c7"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c9" value="2. Rule 1 batch_id (PARAM): its SELECT returns the batch and its run type" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="229" width="620" height="50" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c10" value="memory: params[batch_id], params[batch_run_ty], also Run_Parm_Txt" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="720" y="229" width="460" height="50" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e11" style="endArrow=block;html=1;rounded=0;dashed=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c9" target="c10"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e12" style="endArrow=block;html=1;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c6" target="c9"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c13" value="3. Scope_Sql_Txt: the cases of BTCH_ID = {batch_id} AND RUN_TY = {batch_run_ty}; none: EMPTY_SCOPE" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="299" width="620" height="50" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c14" value="memory: one entry per case, keyed AUTHZN_ID|SRC_DATA_KEY|AUTHZN_REVSN_NUM" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="720" y="299" width="460" height="50" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e15" style="endArrow=block;html=1;rounded=0;dashed=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c13" target="c14"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e16" style="endArrow=block;html=1;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c9" target="c13"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c17" value="4. Rule 2 history 90 days (PRIOR_SELECTION)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="369" width="620" height="50" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c18" value="memory: history[2] from GOVT_RGLTRY_SampleSelection" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="720" y="369" width="460" height="50" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e19" style="endArrow=block;html=1;rounded=0;dashed=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c17" target="c18"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e20" style="endArrow=block;html=1;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c13" target="c17"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c21" value="5. Rule 3 exclusion SELECT (revisions)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="439" width="620" height="50" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c22" value="memory: smp_r_3 = 1 / 0 per case" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="720" y="439" width="460" height="50" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e23" style="endArrow=block;html=1;rounded=0;dashed=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c21" target="c22"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e24" style="endArrow=block;html=1;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c17" target="c21"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c25" value="6. Rule 4 EXPEDITED" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="509" width="620" height="50" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c26" value="memory: smp_r_4 = 1 / 0" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="720" y="509" width="460" height="50" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e27" style="endArrow=block;html=1;rounded=0;dashed=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c25" target="c26"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e28" style="endArrow=block;html=1;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c21" target="c25"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c29" value="7. Rules 19–21, 27–44 determination: one SELECT per bucket (each determination's SELECT runs once, shared by the areas)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="579" width="620" height="50" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c30" value="memory: smp_r_19 … smp_r_21, smp_r_27 … smp_r_44 = 1 for the cases each returned" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="720" y="579" width="460" height="50" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e31" style="endArrow=block;html=1;rounded=0;dashed=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c29" target="c30"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e32" style="endArrow=block;html=1;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c25" target="c29"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c33" value="8. Rules 11 → 6 → 7 → 8 → 9 → 10 → 12 → 13 level 0 bucket SELECTs (rule 5 runs no query)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="649" width="620" height="50" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c34" value="memory: smp_r_6 … smp_r_13 = 1 / 0" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="720" y="649" width="460" height="50" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e35" style="endArrow=block;html=1;rounded=0;dashed=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c33" target="c34"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e36" style="endArrow=block;html=1;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c29" target="c33"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c37" value="9. Rules 15 → 16 → 17 level 1 bucket SELECTs, over every case (rule 14 runs no query)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="719" width="620" height="50" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c38" value="memory: smp_r_15 … smp_r_17 = 1 / 0" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="720" y="719" width="460" height="50" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e39" style="endArrow=block;html=1;rounded=0;dashed=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c37" target="c38"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e40" style="endArrow=block;html=1;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c33" target="c37"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c41" value="10. Rules 22 → 23 → 24 → 25 → 26 cap SELECTs" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="789" width="620" height="50" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c42" value="memory: smp_r_22, smp_r_23 = CPT code, smp_r_24, smp_r_25, smp_r_26" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="720" y="789" width="460" height="50" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e43" style="endArrow=block;html=1;rounded=0;dashed=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c41" target="c42"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e44" style="endArrow=block;html=1;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c37" target="c41"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c45" value="Use: the stamps are applied, nothing is queried again" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontStyle=3;fontColor=#555555;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="370" y="859" width="800" height="26" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c46" value="11. Exclude: rule 2 first, then rule 3; the first hit is the reason" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="893" width="620" height="50" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c47" value="memory: _reason; the case goes to excluded or candidates" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="720" y="893" width="460" height="50" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e48" style="endArrow=block;html=1;rounded=0;dashed=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c46" target="c47"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e49" style="endArrow=block;html=1;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c41" target="c46"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c50" value="12. Rank the candidates: rule 4 expedited first, then AUTHZN_ID, SRC_DATA_KEY, AUTHZN_REVSN_NUM" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="963" width="620" height="50" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c51" value="memory: _order" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="720" y="963" width="460" height="50" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e52" style="endArrow=block;html=1;rounded=0;dashed=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c50" target="c51"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e53" style="endArrow=block;html=1;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c46" target="c50"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c54" value="13. Tree level 0 → 1 → 2 (first bucket in Seq_Nbr order; rules 19–21, 27–44 by area), quotas, RANKED pick per leaf" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1033" width="620" height="50" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c55" value="memory: _path, leaf targets, _skip" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="720" y="1033" width="460" height="50" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e56" style="endArrow=block;html=1;rounded=0;dashed=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c54" target="c55"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e57" style="endArrow=block;html=1;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c50" target="c54"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c58" value="14. Cap rules 22, 23, 24, 25, 26 in rank order: a case over a cap is swapped within its leaf · then TOPUP if short" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1103" width="620" height="50" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c59" value="memory: the final 150" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="720" y="1103" width="460" height="50" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e60" style="endArrow=block;html=1;rounded=0;dashed=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c58" target="c59"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e61" style="endArrow=block;html=1;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c54" target="c58"><mxGeometry relative=