→ 9" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1270" y="1876" width="190" height="48" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c126" value="IP PAC/OTHER&lt;br&gt;SKIP: never picked" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="590" y="1944" width="220" height="56" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e127" style="endArrow=block;html=1;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c75" target="c126"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c128" value="12 OP Medical&lt;br&gt;REMAINDER → 20" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="2016" width="240" height="56" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e129" style="endArrow=block;html=1;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c74" target="c128"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c130" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="850" y="2012" width="640" height="64" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e131" style="endArrow=block;html=1;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c128" target="c130"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c132" value="39 Dismissed&lt;br&gt;PCT 2, at least 1 → 1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="860" y="2020" width="190" height="48" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c133" value="40 Approved&lt;br&gt;PCT 13 → 3" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1065" y="2020" width="190" height="48" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c134" value="41 Denied&lt;br&gt;REMAINDER → 16" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1270" y="2020" width="190" height="48" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c135" value="13 IP Medical&lt;br&gt;REMAINDER → 20" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="2088" width="240" height="56" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e136" style="endArrow=block;html=1;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c74" target="c135"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c137" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="850" y="2084" width="640" height="64" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e138" style="endArrow=block;html=1;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c135" target="c137"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c139" value="42 Dismissed&lt;br&gt;PCT 2, at least 1 → 1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="860" y="2092" width="190" height="48" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c140" value="43 Approved&lt;br&gt;PCT 13 → 3" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1065" y="2092" width="190" height="48" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c141" value="44 Denied&lt;br&gt;REMAINDER → 16" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1270" y="2092" width="190" height="48" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c142" value="OTHER (no area)&lt;br&gt;SKIP: never picked" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="2160" width="240" height="56" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e143" style="endArrow=block;html=1;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c74" target="c142"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c144" value="• Leaves: Concurrent Review + 6 areas × 3 determinations + 3 IP PAC types × 3 determinations = 28. Their targets add up to 150." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="2246" width="1450" height="42" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c145" value="• A case goes to the first level 0 bucket (rule 11, then 6 → 13) whose SELECT returned it, so a concurrent review never counts in an area; then, under IP PAC only, the first of 15 → 17, then the first of its area's three determination buckets (19 → 21 for Part B, 27 → 44 for the others, listed per area; Concurrent Review has none) whose SELECT returned it. Other determination values (Pended, NULL …) match no bucket, become &amp;lt;path&amp;gt;/OTHER and are skipped." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="2292" width="1450" height="42" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c146" value="• Dismissed is 2% of its area but at least 1 (Min_Quota_Cnt): the largest bucket beside it (Denied) gives up the added case. At 1,000 cases the same rules give 2–4 Dismissed per area. • Targets are nominal: every bucket has enough cases. A bucket short of cases gives its slots to its REMAINDER siblings; a bucket with no cases is still written to SamplingRunStat, with 0. Expected counts per bucket: rule plan workbook, tab 11." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="2338" width="1450" height="42" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c147" value="• Caps across the tree (rules 22–26): 22 BH at most 8% of the sample, concurrent reviews not counted · 23 at most 3 cases of one CPT code (every path) · 24 at most 10 out-of-network (Non par) cases in the whole sample · 25 at most 5 cases with a code routed NOPA, Genetic, IPO List or Fast Cert (SHRPA Clinical_Mgt_Route) · 26 at most 75 % expedited in each functional area, IP PAC as IPRF, LTAC and SNF (rounded down). A case over a cap is swapped for the next case in its leaf that fits every cap; TOPUP then fills a shortfall from cases that are not SKIP, within the caps." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="2384" width="1450" height="42" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c148" value="• SKIP cases are written with Selection_Stat = SKIPPED and are never picked by top-up or replace." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="2430" width="1450" height="42" as="geometry" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
